<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="ac-royal sunk section" style="padding-bottom: 80px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Retail analytics questions, answered.</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          What is the cloud back office?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>The cloud back office is Teamwork Commerce's enterprise reporting and analytics platform. Analytics is part of the Teamwork Commerce platform, extending the same Mobile POS you already run, it turns transaction, RFID, and mPOS data into 150+ pre-configured reports covering sales, inventory, associate performance, fulfillment, compliance, and more, with real-time multi-currency support across 40+ countries. Reports run on a schedule and distribute as clean data files or PDFs to the teams who act on them. Live dashboards sit on top of the same data, powered by Looker, and a searchable Data Dictionary keeps every team working from the same field definitions. It's included with your deployment.</p></div>
      </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          What RFID-specific analytics are available?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>RFID analytics include fitting room conversion tracking (items tried vs. purchased), path-to-purchase heatmaps showing product movement through the store, tag velocity monitoring for demand prediction, dead zone and hot zone identification, and stock-out prevention alerts. These physical-world analytics are impossible with barcode-only systems.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Can reports and dashboards be tailored to us?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Beyond the 150+ pre-configured reports, custom reporting is built with you during implementation, around the measures your leadership actually reviews, and custom Looker dashboards sit on top of the same data. Reports can be scheduled for generation and distribution, and tailored by vertical, from high-volume sporting goods to luxury fashion to museum retail.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Does the cloud back office support multi-currency and localized tax reporting?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. View global GMV in your base currency while the system handles exchange rate fluctuations for every market. Localized tax reporting auto-generates VAT summaries for the EU, GST for APAC, and State/Local Sales Tax for the US. Ensuring compliance is built into every report, not bolted on after.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

